{"speciesId":316,"names":{"fr":"Gloupti","es":"Gulpin","en":"Gulpin","ja":"ゴクリン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Virtually all of GULPIN’s body is its stomach. As a result, it can swallow something its own size. This POKéMON’s stomach contains a special fluid that digests anything."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Most of GULPIN’s body is made up of its stomach - its heart and brain are very small in comparison. This POKéMON’s stomach contains special enzymes that dissolve anything."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON’s stomach fluid can even digest scrap iron. In one gulp, it can swallow something that is as large as itself."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"There is nothing its stomach can’t digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"There is nothing its stomach can’t digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has a small heart and brain. Its stomach comprises most of its body, with enzymes to dissolve anything."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has a small heart and brain. Its stomach comprises most of its body, with enzymes to dissolve anything."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est principalement composé d’un estomac dont les sucs digestifs dissolvent tout ce qu’il avale."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est principalement composé d’un estomac dont les sucs digestifs dissolvent tout ce qu’il avale."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est principalement constitué d’un estomac dont les sucs digestifs dissolvent tout."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus sesos y corazón son diminutos; es casi todo estómago. Sus jugos gástricos disuelven lo que sea."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has a small heart and brain. Its stomach comprises most of its body, with enzymes to dissolve anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"心臓や 脳みそは 小さく 体の 大部分が 胃袋。 なんでも 溶かす 胃液を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il n’y a rien que son estomac ne puisse digérer. Pendant sa digestion, il laisse s’échapper des gaz très bruyants et nauséabonds."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es capaz de digerir cualquier cosa. Para hacer la digestión, se ayuda de un fluido y un gas capaces de corroerlo todo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"There is nothing its stomach can’t digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"なんでも 消化する 胃袋。 消化する ときに 発生する ガスは 強烈な 悪臭だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Virtuellement, le corps de Gloupti n’est qu’un estomac. Il est capable d’avaler des objets aussi gros que lui. L’estomac de ce Pokémon contient un fluide spécial qui lui permet de digérer n’importe quoi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Casi la totalidad del cuerpo de Gulpin está compuesto por el estómago. Por eso, puede tragarse todo lo que tenga su tamaño. En el interior del estómago tiene un fluido capaz de corroerlo todo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Virtually all of Gulpin’s body is its stomach. As a result, it can swallow something its own size. This Pokémon’s stomach contains a special fluid that digests anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の ほとんどが 胃袋で できているので 自分と 同じ 大きさの ものも のみ込む。 特殊な 胃液で なんでも 消化するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Gloupti n’est pratiquement qu’un gros estomac. En comparaison, son cœur et son cerveau sont tout petits. L’estomac de ce Pokémon contient des enzymes spéciales capables de tout dissoudre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La mayor parte del cuerpo de Gulpin está ocupado por su estómago. En comparación, el corazón y el cerebro son muy pequeños. Este Pokémon tiene enzimas especiales en el estómago capaces de corroerlo todo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Most of Gulpin’s body is made up of its stomach—its heart and brain are very small in comparison. This Pokémon’s stomach contains special enzymes that dissolve anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体の 大部分が 胃袋で できていて 心臓や 脳みそは とても 小さい。 なんでも 溶かす 特殊な 胃液を 持つ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":316,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machin